fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266RefPicListStruct","fragment":"\n\tGstH266RefPicListStruct\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266RefPicListStruct\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266RefPicListStruct\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 reference picture list.\nspecifies the number of entries in the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure.\nspecifies whether the POC LSBs of the LTRP entries\nindicated in the ref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure\nare present in the same syntax structure.\nspecifies whether the i-th entry in the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure is an ILRP entry.\nspecifies whether the i-th entry in the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure is an STRP entry.\nspecifies the value of the variable\nAbsDeltaPocSt[listIdx][rplsIdx][i].\nspecifies whether DeltaPocValSt[listIdx][rplsIdx]\nis greater than or equal to 0.\nspecifies the value of the picture order count modulo\nMaxPicOrderCntLsb of the picture referred to.\nspecifies the index of the ILRP entry of the i-th entry in the\nref_pic_list_struct.\nthe number of short term reference picture.\nthe number long term reference picture.\nthe number of inter layer reference picture.\nthe calculated DeltaPocValSt value.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 reference picture list.\nspecifies the number of entries in the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure.\nspecifies whether the POC LSBs of the LTRP entries\nindicated in the ref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure\nare present in the same syntax structure.\nspecifies whether the i-th entry in the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure is an ILRP entry.\nspecifies whether the i-th entry in the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure is an STRP entry.\nspecifies the value of the variable\nAbsDeltaPocSt[listIdx][rplsIdx][i].\nspecifies whether DeltaPocValSt[listIdx][rplsIdx]\nis greater than or equal to 0.\nspecifies the value of the picture order count modulo\nMaxPicOrderCntLsb of the picture referred to.\nspecifies the index of the ILRP entry of the i-th entry in the\nref_pic_list_struct.\nthe number of short term reference picture.\nthe number long term reference picture.\nthe number of inter layer reference picture.\nthe calculated DeltaPocValSt value.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 reference picture list.\nspecifies the number of entries in the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure.\nspecifies whether the POC LSBs of the LTRP entries\nindicated in the ref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure\nare present in the same syntax structure.\nspecifies whether the i-th entry in the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure is an ILRP entry.\nspecifies whether the i-th entry in the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structure is an STRP entry.\nspecifies the value of the variable\nAbsDeltaPocSt[listIdx][rplsIdx][i].\nspecifies whether DeltaPocValSt[listIdx][rplsIdx]\nis greater than or equal to 0.\nspecifies the value of the picture order count modulo\nMaxPicOrderCntLsb of the picture referred to.\nspecifies the index of the ILRP entry of the i-th entry in the\nref_pic_list_struct.\nthe number of short term reference picture.\nthe number long term reference picture.\nthe number of inter layer reference picture.\nthe calculated DeltaPocValSt value.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});